WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.565
The glass clock fell toward the floor.

2
00:00:04.566 --> 00:00:09.929
Sprite flew fast and caught it.

3
00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.405
Feather and Hob clapped.

4
00:00:12.406 --> 00:00:15.734
The Fairy Queen smiled.

5
00:00:15.735 --> 00:00:19.793
Bumble looked down and tried not to cry.

6
00:00:19.794 --> 00:00:24.725
"I make so many mistakes!" he thought.

7
00:00:24.726 --> 00:00:28.280
"I'll never be fast like Sprite.

8
00:00:28.281 --> 00:00:33.824
Or perfect like Super Fairy."

9
00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:37.735
"Let's fly to the Wish Factory fast!" Feather said.

10
00:00:37.736 --> 00:00:47.783
"Wait." Hob looked at the heavy window.

11
00:00:47.784 --> 00:00:54.157
He sprinkled some light powder and then opened it.

12
00:00:54.158 --> 00:01:04.551
"Now it will be easy to get back in."

13
00:01:04.552 --> 00:01:08.807
At the Wish Factory, Blinx hurried over.

14
00:01:08.808 --> 00:01:11.767
He bowed to the Fairy Queen.

15
00:01:11.768 --> 00:01:16.165
"It's nice to see you again, Blinx," the Queen said.

16
00:01:16.166 --> 00:01:20.790
"I'm giving these fairies a speed test today."

17
00:01:20.791 --> 00:01:25.354
"Can you help us work fast?" Hob asked.

18
00:01:25.355 --> 00:01:31.817
"Blinx always works fast," the Queen said.

19
00:01:31.818 --> 00:01:36.304
"Not really," Sprite whispered.

20
00:01:36.305 --> 00:01:45.125
Blinx took the wishbit and hurried off.

21
00:01:45.126 --> 00:01:49.415
A few minutes later, he was back. "You're

22
00:01:49.416 --> 00:01:52.230
all set," he said. He

23
00:01:52.231 --> 00:01:55.042
handed the wishbit to Bumble. "Come

24
00:01:55.043 --> 00:02:00.429
on!" Feather cried. The

25
00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:03.007
fairies shot back to Nick's house. They

26
00:02:03.008 --> 00:02:08.347
went in through the open window. "I'll

27
00:02:08.348 --> 00:02:11.834
put the wishbit back," Bumble said. The

28
00:02:11.835 --> 00:02:18.996
Fairy Queen frowned. "And I'll watch you!" Bumble

29
00:02:18.997 --> 00:02:21.357
zipped up to the shelf. The

30
00:02:21.358 --> 00:02:24.209
Fairy Queen flew right behind him. Suddenly—

31
00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.366
thump!

32
00:02:26.367 --> 00:02:28.355
She bumped into a clock.

33
00:02:28.356 --> 00:02:34.235
Brr-rr-ring! The clock rang loudly.

34
00:02:34.236 --> 00:02:41.309
"Quick!" Sprite cried. "Hide!"

35
00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:43.990
Sprite darted into the drawer of a chest.

36
00:02:43.991 --> 00:02:46.891
The others darted after her.

37
00:02:46.892 --> 00:02:51.172
The ringing finally stopped.

38
00:02:51.173 --> 00:02:55.974
But then Nick burst into the room.

39
00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:58.863
He checked the clock.

40
00:02:58.864 --> 00:03:01.427
"That's strange," he said.

41
00:03:01.428 --> 00:03:04.207
"Why did the alarm go off?"

42
00:03:04.208 --> 00:03:07.131
He put the clock back on the shelf.

43
00:03:07.132 --> 00:03:11.199
As Nick spun around, he saw the open drawer.

44
00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:15.475
He went over and shut it.

45
00:03:15.476 --> 00:03:20.349
"Oh no!" Bumble said as everything went dark.

46
00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:24.860
"We're trapped!"

